7
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:17,650
That's right.

8
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:23,790
Different coins, so different sizes and shapes, they have different names because they represent different amounts of money.

9
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:28,790
So today we're going to learn the names of those coins and we're also going to learn a little bit about British money.

10
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:30,070
So let's check out the dialogue.

11
